# Finish gate (LAW)

Canonical: `AIRULES/00-AGENT-CONTRACT.md` §2c. Tick `AIRULES/17-CHECKLISTS.md` Finish gate.

After **every** code chunk **and** before saying done: **MUST** grep this module. **MUST NOT** imagine the result. **MUST NOT** claim done if any row fails. Fail = fix **now**.

| Check | Fail if |
|-------|---------|
| **CRC once** | `crcCheck()` in middleware/`before`/`#DACore:AuthTest@CRC!` **and** in the action; CRC on GET; CRC on `$request->upload()`; PHPDoc `CRCchecking —` names a prefix **and** the method still `crcCheck()`; a new public controller/middleware method with no `CRCchecking —` first line |
| **IDs** | Plain `value="7"` / `data-id="7"` / `{{ var: $id }}` sent to the browser — need `{{ enc(Shop.item.id): $id }}` unique `$key2`. Pager `data-page` must be ciphertext (`AIRULES/40`) |
| **Queries** | User input in SQL; `$qb->raw()` `?` that is not a binding (comments count) |
| **Inputs** | Password/HTML/hash from `$request->data()` not `data(true)`; persist only gated in JS (if the plan named step-up, PHP still refuses without a code; invented step-up on ordinary Save is also a fail) |
| **Middleware** | Login `before` missing or handlers outside `Auth::isLogged()`; two CRC layers; `#DACore:AuthTest@check!` as a rights guard |
| **DACore files** | Diff touches `app/modules/DACore/` without the informed exception (`AIRULES/00` §1) |
| **Visible outcome** | Silent `.after()`; admin save without a DACore toast; public field errors without marking the input (`AIRULES/00` §2d) |
| **Privilege / records** | Secret (TOTP/QR/key) in a read-only view; mutate a more privileged operator; `WHERE id` only after decrypt; own password with no current-password check (`AIRULES/11` §11) |
| **Catch reported** | A `catch` or `execute()` `$err` that does not call the module report helper → `dotapp.catch` + `dotapp.catch.error|info`; ad-hoc payload keys; a secret/token/rights blob/request body in the payload; the helper or listener placed under `app/modules/DACore/` (`AIRULES/18` §9) |
| **Perf / readability** | `->all()` on a growing table; query/HTTP/rights check/log inside `foreach`; `select('*')` on a list; O(n²) or array copy per row; a new `WHERE`/`ORDER BY` column with no index; an index with no comment naming its query; a duplicate of a library DACore ships; a public method with tags-only PHPDoc (`@return array<string, mixed>` and no purpose sentence); comments that restate the code (`AIRULES/25` §8) |
| **Threat pass** | Unescaped user string in a view or `.html()`; sort/insert column from the request; input in `header()` / redirect / `HttpHelper` URL; `eval`/`exec`/`unserialize`; public POST with no `throttle()`; `getMessage()` / `var_dump` in the reply; upload without ext + `finfo` + headers; a write to `dacore_*` / `users_rights*` (`AIRULES/24` §11) |
| **Hooks** | Useful side-effect (SMS/mail/paid/lockout) with no `module.{mod}.{name}.hook`; old `shop.item.saved` shape; trigger without `Hook:`/`Why:`/`Params:`/`Use:`; hook on a trivial save; secrets; `trigger()` inside a growing `foreach` (`AIRULES/41`) |
| **Extender** | `extend()` delayed to Module initialize; target URLs in Module map; missing explicit listener routes with Module `[]`; `.loaded` for initialize-time; `call()` without owner `exists()`; ordinary result not returned; `original()` marker returned/serialized instead of `isOriginal()`; fake `NEXT`; `$request`/secrets; Events; `['*']` just to attach; duplicate; DACore patch (`AIRULES/12` §10) |
| **PHP 7.4+** | PHP 8+ syntax (`match`, `?->`, `str_contains`, union/`mixed`, named args, promotion, `#[`, `enum`, `readonly`) unless the plan named a higher version (`AIRULES/00` §2i) |
| **Comments** | Logical step without `// Why:`; new page action without `// About:` / `// Section:`; PHPDoc with no purpose sentence; controller/middleware public method whose PHPDoc does not start with `CRCchecking —` (`AIRULES/25` §7) |
| **Cursor rules** | A new `.mdc` exists only under `.cursor/rules/`; AIRULES cursor rules were not copied into `.cursor/rules/` (`AIRULES/00` §2l) |
| **defaultSettings** | Wake list or `Router` path built from Config without `defaultSettings()` first; foreign `prefixUrl` composed before that module’s defaults; hardcoded foreign fallback (`AIRULES/00` §2m) |
| **Module AIRULES** | Named host `AIRULES/` exists but was not read; pack registered routes the host does not listen to; new host with no `app/modules/<This>/AIRULES/`; module rules used to skip project law (`AIRULES/00` §2n) |
| **PLAN folder** | New module / rewrite with no `app/modules/<This>/PLAN/`; chat-only plan; one mega-file instead of a split folder; screen/position not in PLAN; PLAN used to skip project law (`AIRULES/00` §2o) |
| **DACore zip** | Zip contains `PLAN/` or `install.php`; invented packer (`AIRULES/00` §2e) |
| **Rule stack** | Host `PLAN/` opened while writing a pack; project `AIRULES/` skipped because a module folder exists; pack ignored host `AIRULES/` (`AIRULES/00` §2p) |

Grep: `Middleware/`, `module.init.php`, Controllers, views, JS, **and the diff**.
